$comment_add_area:
TO ADD ANOTHER AREA: append another object to `areas[]` above with a unique `id`, a `label` (button text), a `defaultDoc`, and a non-empty `docs[]`. It becomes a new button on line 1 of the topnav; its own docs populate line 2 when the area is active. Also consider whether to change `defaultArea` at the top so the new area becomes the landing. Example shape (mirrors the `docs` area above):

    {
      "id": "reference",
      "label": "Reference",
      "defaultDoc": "overview",
      "docs": [
        {
          "id": "overview",
          "label": "Overview",
          "icon": "📚",
          "title": "Reference Overview",
          "sources": ["reference/overview.md"]
        }
      ]
    }
